            <hr />
          </div>

          <p>
            We run a cluster of <strong>headless browser</strong> instances.
          </p>

          <p>
            To <strong>render</strong> the previously collected
            experimentation data.
          </p>

          <p>
            And generate textual and visual
            <strong>diffs</strong> from the variation.
          </p>

        </div>
